<Layout title="机场问题百科 - 机场湾" description="解决所有关于机场、节点、线路、Clash订阅等新手常见问题。">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center">机场常见问题百科</h1>
    <div class="relative mb-12">
      <input type="text" placeholder="搜索机场问题..." class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-midnight focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-blue" />
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      {questions.map((item, idx) => (
        <details class="group bg-white dark:bg-midnight rounded-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium">
            <h2 class="text-lg">{item.q}</h2>
